      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786128530127,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. LLM proposes intent. \n2. Agent runtime orchestrates.\n3. MCP standardizes capability access. \n4. Policy gateway owns authority. \n5. MCP server adapts to the domain service. Product services remain the source of truth.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. LLM proposes intent. \n2. Agent runtime orchestrates.\n3. MCP standardizes capability access. \n4. Policy gateway owns authority. \n5. MCP server adapts to the domain service. Product services remain the source of truth.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
